WEBVTT

00:03:28.836 --> 00:03:30.196
Keep your head down.

00:03:30.956 --> 00:03:32.116
Do your work.

00:03:32.676 --> 00:03:35.516
And don't get into trouble.

00:03:36.356 --> 00:03:38.276
Get yourself a piece of the pie, right?

00:03:38.276 --> 00:03:42.956
But that suggests the payoff
will be in a world

00:03:42.996 --> 00:03:45.276
similar to the ones
our parents grew up in.

00:03:46.276 --> 00:03:48.156
London was hot, boy.

00:03:48.156 --> 00:03:49.876
Forty degrees,

00:03:49.916 --> 00:03:52.236
one of the hottest summers in history

00:03:52.276 --> 00:03:56.796
after one of the hottest
summers in history.

00:03:56.796 --> 00:03:58.756
Some people couldn’t go outside.

00:03:58.796 --> 00:04:01.316
Plants were either dried up or on fire.